{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1126676-what-s-with-the-missing-areas-in-the-kingdom-of-northern-ice","id":1126676,"title":"What's With The Missing Areas in the Kingdom of Northern Ice?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-08-09T06:30:13-07:00","id":1126676,"title":"What's With The Missing Areas in the Kingdom of Northern Ice?","content":"The Kingdom of Northern Ice (Alaska and Canada) mentions the following areas: Saskatchewan, Quebec, Ontario, Nunavut, British Columbia, P.E.I, Manitoba, Alaska, the Northwest Territories, and the Yukon Territory. These places all have names being duchies, free realms, or lands. But what of Nova Scotia, New Brunswick, Newfoundland and Labrador, and Alberta? Why are these places unnamed in the Books? Were there actually names intended for these or were Story-tellers meant to name them? Has anybody given them names? If so, would you feel like sharing them?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13647-manannansun","name":"Manannansun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"78"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T11:45:51-07:00","id":1126790,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Manannansun</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1126676-what-s-with-the-missing-areas-in-the-kingdom-of-northern-ice#post1126676\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The Kingdom of Northern Ice (Alaska and Canada) mentions the following areas: Saskatchewan, Quebec, Ontario, Nunavut, British Columbia, P.E.I, Manitoba, Alaska, the Northwest Territories, and the Yukon Territory. These places all have names being duchies, free realms, or lands. But what of Nova Scotia, New Brunswick, Newfoundland and Labrador, and Alberta? Why are these places unnamed in the Books? Were there actually names intended for these or were Story-tellers meant to name them? Has anybody given them names? If so, would you feel like sharing them?</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> There are a couple places left out like that. I Personally say that in said areas the government has broken down into mad max levels of chaos in the Dreaming....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2715-lian","name":"Lian","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5218"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T16:34:21-07:00","id":1126878,"title":"","content":"i figured it was just oversight and hope to see it corrected *fingers crossed*","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5533-cameraobscura83","name":"CameraObscura83","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar5533_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-08-09T16:46:24-07:00","id":1126884,"title":"","content":"I'm kicking myself for not catching t